review:
I can't say it's a perfect game. It does suffer from some Ubisoft cliches. But hear me out.

If you just:
- set difficulty to maximum possible;
- disable most of HUD elements - especially minimap, item and enemy markers;
- do not allocate skill points into skills that are obviously making game much easier - like more HP, rebel HP, supressor without damage penalty etc;
- limit (not necessarily completely) use of drone - use binoculars instead where possible;
- limit use of sync shot - only use when necessary;
Then you get possibly the best open world tactical shooter currently available. Especially fun with friends.

Can recommend on sale, on which it goes pretty often.
